WEBVTT

00:00:00.411 --> 00:00:04.074
Could you listen to me for a second?
One day, I picked up a little fairy.

00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:07.809
And, can you believe it? The little girl can
even use magic, though she's a goof ball.

00:00:08.019 --> 00:00:09.850
I'm not a goof ball. I'm Sugar!

00:00:10.588 --> 00:00:13.580
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:13.791 --> 00:00:16.726
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:16.928 --> 00:00:20.887
Namida no rouge

00:00:41.252 --> 00:00:44.881
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:45.189 --> 00:00:51.822
Ai nante, Shiritaku naiwa

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:58.998
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:59.203 --> 00:01:01.831
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:05.771
Namida no rouge

00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:13.642
Mokuyo ni

00:01:13.851 --> 00:01:16.752
Bara o kai

00:01:16.954 --> 00:01:20.321
Tegami o soete

00:01:25.363 --> 00:01:27.797
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:30.930
Yume de au

00:01:31.135 --> 00:01:35.367
Anata wa yasashii

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:51.250
Why did I pick up such a thing?

00:01:52.256 --> 00:01:56.955
Ugh! I'm not "such a thing"!
I'm Sugar! Sugar! Are you listening?

00:01:57.028 --> 00:01:59.861
- It's Sugar! Don't you get it? Sugar! Sugar!
- All right. All right. I don't really care,

00:01:59.931 --> 00:02:01.489
but to begin with,
what in the world are you?

00:02:01.699 --> 00:02:04.167
A fairy? A ghost? An alien?

00:02:04.502 --> 00:02:06.537
How come only I can see you?

00:02:06.537 --> 00:02:10.405
It's because... well... umm...

00:02:10.508 --> 00:02:11.907
You don't know?

00:02:12.510 --> 00:02:14.603
You can see me because you can!

00:02:14.679 --> 00:02:18.115
- So, why can I see you?
- Why does it matter if you can see me?

00:02:18.282 --> 00:02:21.308
It's a nuisance.
It's not like I want to see you.

00:02:21.552 --> 00:02:23.486
- Then, don't look!
- What I mean is...

00:02:23.955 --> 00:02:25.718
Ah! Wind Fairy!

00:02:26.524 --> 00:02:27.525
Wind Fairy?

00:02:27.525 --> 00:02:30.528
Hi! Mr. Wind Fairy! Yahoo!

00:02:30.528 --> 00:02:33.497
Wind Fairy? You mean he created
the wind earlier?

00:02:34.532 --> 00:02:39.128
- Hey, you! You don't know anything!
- I'm not "hey, you". I'm Saga! Saga!

00:02:39.337 --> 00:02:43.296
Then, Saga, you know there are different
seasons like spring, summer, fall, winter...

00:02:43.508 --> 00:02:48.513
...in the human world. Right?
They are all created by us Season Fairies.

00:02:48.513 --> 00:02:50.481
Season Fairies?

00:02:51.516 --> 00:02:54.485
Rain Fairy to create rainfall.
Wind Fairy to call for winds.

00:02:54.552 --> 00:02:56.921
Sun Fairy to make the sun shine.

00:02:56.921 --> 00:03:00.525
We're creating the seasons
by manipulating nature.

00:03:00.525 --> 00:03:03.528
For the longest time it's been this way.

00:03:03.528 --> 00:03:06.531
And, you're telling me that you're one
of Season Fairies?

00:03:06.531 --> 00:03:08.099
Yes! Sugar is a Snow Fairy!

00:03:08.099 --> 00:03:10.201
Though I'm still an apprentice.

00:03:10.201 --> 00:03:12.537
In order to become a
fully-fledged Snow Fairy,

00:03:12.537 --> 00:03:14.372
I came to the human world as part of the

00:03:14.372 --> 00:03:16.507
extracurricular activities
at the magic school.

00:03:16.507 --> 00:03:20.341
I'll study lots and lots about humans, and...

00:03:20.511 --> 00:03:23.344
I'll become a great Snow Fairy like
my dear Mommy.

00:03:23.447 --> 00:03:27.577
Mommy? So, your mother
is a Snow Fairy, too?

00:03:27.652 --> 00:03:30.521
Yup. My dear Mommy is the best of the
best Snow Fairy and,

00:03:30.521 --> 00:03:34.525
Saga, what's wrong?
Hurry up, or you'll be late!
The snow flakes my dear Mommy makes
are big and very pretty, and...

00:03:34.525 --> 00:03:35.560
Yes!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:39.496
Excuse me! Where are you going?
I was getting to the important point!

00:03:42.533 --> 00:03:45.503
Look what you did! It's dangerous!

00:03:45.503 --> 00:03:48.472
Sorry. Sorry. I need to hurry up,
or I'll be late for school.

00:03:48.539 --> 00:03:52.168
What? School? Is there a school
in the human world, too?

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.206
What? There is a school
in your world, too?

00:03:55.513 --> 00:03:58.549
Don't be ridiculous! Of course!
Ah! I've got a great idea!

00:03:58.549 --> 00:04:02.542
Sugar wants to go to
a human's school, too!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.553
Come on, hurry. Let's go to school!
You've got to be kidding.

00:04:06.123 --> 00:04:07.613
Bye. I'll be back!

00:04:08.526 --> 00:04:13.486
Hurry up and let me out!
Come on, Saga! Saga!

00:04:14.532 --> 00:04:17.501
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:04:22.206 --> 00:04:26.142
Ah! Saga, wait for me!

00:04:41.058 --> 00:04:41.692
Let's see.

00:04:41.692 --> 00:04:45.529
Today I'm supposed to go to Norma's
house after school as I promised. So...

00:04:45.529 --> 00:04:47.588
...I need to plan what we'll do to play and...

00:04:48.532 --> 00:04:50.500
Saga, I found you! Saga!

00:04:52.536 --> 00:04:53.537
Whoa!

00:04:53.537 --> 00:04:54.538
Why are you?

00:04:54.538 --> 00:04:57.541
Sugar is going to Saga's school, too.

00:04:57.541 --> 00:04:59.510
Ah! Wait for me!

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:00.778
She's gotta be kidding.

00:05:00.778 --> 00:05:04.515
If "such a thing" comes along with me,
it will completely ruin my day!

00:05:04.515 --> 00:05:05.482
Ah... Saga!

00:05:05.549 --> 00:05:06.516
What?

00:05:10.621 --> 00:05:13.112
I'm hungry. I can't move any more!

00:05:13.958 --> 00:05:14.925
Uh...

00:05:17.061 --> 00:05:19.291
Ahh! This is what I ate yesterday!

00:05:19.864 --> 00:05:24.028
- This one looks so good! This one, too!
- Ah, this was NOT in my plan.

00:05:24.235 --> 00:05:26.760
- Saga, which one should I get?
- Pick one by yourself!

00:05:26.971 --> 00:05:29.166
What? You mean me?

00:05:29.373 --> 00:05:31.542
What? Ah, no, no. Never mind!

00:05:31.542 --> 00:05:34.170
I'm so sorry. I'll take this one.

00:05:34.545 --> 00:05:36.479
Sugar wants THIS one!

00:05:37.515 --> 00:05:38.777
Oh, no. This one over here.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.210
- But, this one over here looks better!
- Oh, no. This one over here.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.945
- Oh, no. This one over here!
This one! This!
- Oh, no. This one over here...

00:05:45.022 --> 00:05:46.922
- Oh, no. This one over here!
This one! This!
- Oh, no. This one over here...

00:05:54.899 --> 00:05:58.096
Well, Saga, what is this called?
Hello? Hello?

00:05:58.536 --> 00:05:59.969
It's a waffle.

00:06:00.538 --> 00:06:01.973
A waffo?

00:06:01.973 --> 00:06:09.470
Waffle! Baked flour sweets! Ah! Come on!
It doesn't matter! Just hurry up and eat!

00:06:11.515 --> 00:06:13.073
Are you done yet?

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:15.778
Zzzz... Zzzz...

00:06:16.854 --> 00:06:17.513
Hey!

00:06:23.427 --> 00:06:25.019
- Miss Anne.
- Here.

00:06:25.463 --> 00:06:27.064
- Miss Greta.
- Here.

00:06:27.064 --> 00:06:29.225
- Miss Norma.
- Here.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:30.858
Miss Saga.

00:06:31.402 --> 00:06:32.869
Miss Saga?

00:06:35.539 --> 00:06:39.510
Teacher, Saga hasn't come to school
this morning.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:43.514
Absent?
That's strange. Saga... of all people.

00:06:43.514 --> 00:06:46.540
We haven't heard from her home.

00:06:48.519 --> 00:06:49.553
Miss Saga!

00:06:49.553 --> 00:06:54.490
I'm... I'm sorry. I'm... I'm... late!

00:06:55.526 --> 00:07:00.531
What in the world happened, Miss Saga.
You are never tardy, Miss Saga.

00:07:00.531 --> 00:07:01.532
Did something happen?

00:07:01.532 --> 00:07:06.026
Wow. Huh, this is a school for humans.
Uh, no, well... it's because of this thing...

00:07:06.537 --> 00:07:10.496
It's all right, Miss Saga.
Don't blame yourself so harshly.

00:07:11.542 --> 00:07:12.543
What are you doing, Saga?

00:07:12.543 --> 00:07:16.514
Teacher! Please begin the lesson
immediately.

00:07:16.514 --> 00:07:19.550
Indeed, tardiness is a shameful act
for a human being.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:23.521
Besides, it is not forgivable
to delay our class even more.

00:07:23.521 --> 00:07:27.525
The earth is not rotating
around Miss Saga.

00:07:27.525 --> 00:07:31.529
It's admirable, Miss Greta. You thought
Miss Saga would be scolded by me.

00:07:31.529 --> 00:07:33.497
So, you're trying to cover up for her!

00:07:34.532 --> 00:07:36.500
Miss Saga. In respect to the
friendship of you two,

00:07:37.501 --> 00:07:40.538
No, no. That's not what I meant...
I'll write off the tardiness.
Go take your seat.

00:07:40.538 --> 00:07:41.539
Yes.

00:07:41.539 --> 00:07:43.507
Now let's start our class.

00:07:44.542 --> 00:07:46.510
We're starting with page 38 today.
Wasn't it?

00:07:46.844 --> 00:07:49.914
Miss Elise, please come forward and
write the answer on the blackboard.

00:07:49.914 --> 00:07:50.710
Yes.

00:07:51.515 --> 00:07:53.517
I'm glad you came, Saga.

00:07:53.517 --> 00:07:57.855
During the lunch break, we're going to
collect materials for science experiments.

00:07:57.855 --> 00:07:58.522
Help us!

00:07:58.522 --> 00:08:02.193
I know you're just collecting junk.
No, I won't!

00:08:02.193 --> 00:08:03.527
Uh! You're not very sociable.

00:08:03.527 --> 00:08:05.825
So, this is a school for humans.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.226
Never interrupt the class, please!

00:08:09.533 --> 00:08:10.534
I know!

00:08:10.534 --> 00:08:12.502
Now, I'm gonna study hard!

00:08:21.545 --> 00:08:24.480
Waffo! Seconds, please!

00:08:28.552 --> 00:08:30.281
- I'm starving.
- Me, too.

00:08:30.554 --> 00:08:34.718
Saga's tardiness is unprecedented.
I doubted my own eyes.

00:08:34.992 --> 00:08:37.859
But, how come you were late, Saga?

00:08:39.163 --> 00:08:41.131
- Uh... well... you ask me why, but...
- I've made it.

00:08:41.298 --> 00:08:47.066
But, I'm glad you came. If Saga were
absent, it would ruin our plan for today.

00:08:47.138 --> 00:08:48.606
I know. Today, after school,

00:08:48.606 --> 00:08:51.542
we're supposed to go to
your house to play as we promised.

00:08:51.542 --> 00:08:53.544
Yeah! Sugar is going, too!

00:08:53.544 --> 00:08:56.514
Well, well,
what shall we play at Norma's?

00:08:56.514 --> 00:08:58.115
What are you gonna play?

00:08:58.115 --> 00:09:01.516
You must have an idea, don't you?
You always do, Saga, Huh?

00:09:01.886 --> 00:09:04.455
Come on, Saga. Come on! Come on!
I'm not a cat!

00:09:04.455 --> 00:09:06.616
Hey, Saga, are you all right?

00:09:07.525 --> 00:09:09.493
Ah, What? Oh, nothing at all!

00:09:10.528 --> 00:09:12.530
Saga, you're a little weird, today.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.498
Oh, that's not true!

00:09:17.034 --> 00:09:19.434
What's wrong? You ARE being weird.

00:09:19.537 --> 00:09:22.472
I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.202
By the way, can I ask you something?

00:09:25.376 --> 00:09:27.344
- Yeah.
- What is it?

00:09:27.912 --> 00:09:32.008
Have... have you heard of Season Fairies?

00:09:32.183 --> 00:09:33.946
- Season Fairies?
- Season Fairies?

00:09:34.051 --> 00:09:35.152
It's me!

00:09:35.152 --> 00:09:38.088
Well, it's about this big,

00:09:38.088 --> 00:09:40.024
with a strange hat and...

00:09:40.024 --> 00:09:42.059
it has wings on its back and...

00:09:42.059 --> 00:09:43.994
it has a little purse and...

00:09:43.994 --> 00:09:46.230
It takes a magic flute out of it and...

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.222
Excuse me! I'm not strange!
Let go of me!
It uses strange magic. It likes waffles
and likes to eat.

00:09:49.533 --> 00:09:53.492
I'm not bratty. I'm not annoying! Let go!
On top of that, it goes to sleep as soon
as it eats. It's bratty, annoying and...

00:09:54.538 --> 00:09:56.506
I've never heard of it, but what about it?

00:09:57.508 --> 00:10:01.512
Let go of me! Saga, let go of me!
By accident, you pick one up and it follows
to nag you all the time. What would you do?

00:10:01.512 --> 00:10:03.446
What do you mean by nagging?

00:10:03.547 --> 00:10:07.449
Saga, you do sound strange.
You might have a fever.

00:10:07.518 --> 00:10:09.520
Right. People would think that normally...

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.782
Hello, Miss Saga.

00:10:10.854 --> 00:10:14.525
It was pretty inept to start the day with
being tardy.

00:10:14.525 --> 00:10:17.494
Such conduct could disqualify you from
being my rival!

00:10:17.962 --> 00:10:23.491
It's all because You got punished for
brushing me off yesterday!

00:10:24.501 --> 00:10:25.468
Yesterday?

00:10:25.803 --> 00:10:28.533
- Your pajamas are
showing under your skirt.
- What?

00:10:28.706 --> 00:10:30.970
Don't you have something to tell me?

00:10:31.141 --> 00:10:32.972
I'm already late! I'm sorry,
Norma and Anne, but I need to get going.

00:10:33.177 --> 00:10:35.475
Ah, those... Those were...

00:10:35.679 --> 00:10:37.044
- I don't want to hear any more excuses!
- Yes.

00:10:37.648 --> 00:10:39.850
Well, enough of what happened yesterday.

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:42.286
Now, I have something
I want to show to you.

00:10:42.286 --> 00:10:43.354
Something to show me?

00:10:43.354 --> 00:10:44.582
This is it.

00:10:45.522 --> 00:10:47.956
What? What? I can't see it!

00:10:48.092 --> 00:10:51.528
So? You can't utter a sound because
you're envious?

00:10:51.528 --> 00:10:55.532
This is a ring my father
bought for me abroad.

00:10:55.532 --> 00:11:01.493
Ah, its shine absolutely deserves me
who is number one in this class.

00:11:04.174 --> 00:11:05.198
Twinkle?

00:11:05.276 --> 00:11:07.544
It's Twinkle!

00:11:07.544 --> 00:11:08.033
Twinkle!

00:11:08.512 --> 00:11:09.001
Ah!

00:11:09.179 --> 00:11:10.339
I did it!

00:11:22.192 --> 00:11:23.352
Miss Saga,

00:11:23.527 --> 00:11:28.157
Why do I have to be shoved away?
Why? Tell me why?

00:11:28.265 --> 00:11:31.535
Why did you bring such a thing to school,
Miss Greta?

00:11:31.535 --> 00:11:33.837
- Teacher...
- You snuck it out of your home, didn't you?

00:11:33.837 --> 00:11:35.771
You need to come with me.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:39.203
- You're going to pay for this, Miss Saga!
- Let's go!

00:11:39.543 --> 00:11:43.980
Come on! What did you do that for
out of the blue?

00:11:44.048 --> 00:11:46.516
Saga, wasn't that a "Twinkle"?

00:11:47.518 --> 00:11:48.485
A "Twinkle"?

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:03.534
In order for us apprentices to become
fully-fledged Season Fairies,

00:12:03.534 --> 00:12:06.503
We need to look for "Twinkles"
in the human world!

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:09.039
So, what are they? What do you mean
by "Twinkles"?

00:12:09.039 --> 00:12:11.473
A "Twinkle" is... um... well... that is...

00:12:11.542 --> 00:12:13.510
You don't know the answer, do you?

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:16.377
Lf... if I knew,
I would find it too easily? Right?

00:12:16.447 --> 00:12:21.475
Ah, then, Saga, don't you know?
Where is a "Twinkle"?

00:12:21.552 --> 00:12:24.316
Please, please, tell me. Please, Saga.

00:12:24.521 --> 00:12:27.490
Please, please tell me.
Saga, Saga! Please!

00:12:27.558 --> 00:12:31.722
Come on! You're a human, but you
don't know about the world of humans?

00:12:31.795 --> 00:12:34.855
Saga, are you really a human?

00:12:34.932 --> 00:12:36.957
You have no reason to
talk to me like that!

00:12:37.034 --> 00:12:38.467
Ugh. I can't breathe.

00:12:38.535 --> 00:12:41.299
Where are the Twinkles?
Twinkles are... Look!

00:12:41.472 --> 00:12:44.305
That tree! The sun streaming through
the leaves are Twinkles, and...

00:12:44.408 --> 00:12:46.205
...the puddles underneath are Twinkles!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.477
Do you understand?

00:12:49.513 --> 00:12:51.481
I can't breathe, Saga.

00:12:52.516 --> 00:12:54.507
Very well. Now, you may begin.

00:12:55.519 --> 00:13:00.424
Don't put it too close to the lamp,
because the glass plate might break.

00:13:00.424 --> 00:13:01.482
Yes, Ma'am.

00:13:02.526 --> 00:13:03.754
What are you doing?

00:13:03.827 --> 00:13:05.488
It's a science experiment.

00:13:09.533 --> 00:13:11.535
Ah! Snow flakes!

00:13:11.535 --> 00:13:14.470
- Anne, let me do it, too.
- All right. All right.
Why? Are you a Snow Fairy, too, Saga?

00:13:14.538 --> 00:13:16.665
No, I'm not. This is salt.

00:13:17.508 --> 00:13:20.277
What? It looks like snowflakes.

00:13:20.277 --> 00:13:24.348
Ah! Maybe this is a "Twinkle".
Saga, what do you think?

00:13:24.348 --> 00:13:26.475
Like I said, it's salt!

00:13:26.617 --> 00:13:31.486
Salt? It's not a "Twinkle"?
Hello, Salt.

00:13:33.524 --> 00:13:34.923
Ah! Stings my tongue!

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.656
- You ARE acting weird.
- What's wrong, Saga?

00:13:40.097 --> 00:13:43.624
Well, my hands are a little sticky with salt.

00:13:43.734 --> 00:13:44.802
How is it?

00:13:44.802 --> 00:13:46.429
A little bit longer...

00:13:46.503 --> 00:13:48.368
Mr. Phil? What are you doing?

00:13:48.539 --> 00:13:51.303
What do you mean what?
It's an experiment, Teacher.

00:13:51.408 --> 00:13:54.468
Right now we're working on the experiment
to extract salt from salt water.

00:13:54.545 --> 00:13:56.547
What in the world is that device?

00:13:56.547 --> 00:13:59.550
This is my invention.
It's a device to create rain.

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.518
I call it "Rain Genie EX".

00:14:01.518 --> 00:14:04.922
Rain-manufacturing "Rain Genie EX"?

00:14:04.922 --> 00:14:08.119
That's right. It's an invention by
a genius scientist Phil!

00:14:08.525 --> 00:14:12.621
With this, any time anywhere,
you can create rainfalls.
That Phil...
he invented something weird again.

00:14:12.963 --> 00:14:15.431
Therefore, with this, water shortage
problems will be solved.
Humans make rain, too?

00:14:15.532 --> 00:14:16.533
Let Sugar see it!

00:14:16.533 --> 00:14:17.534
It 's so dumb!

00:14:17.534 --> 00:14:22.506
There is no way you can make rain with
such a shabby-Iooking device!

00:14:22.506 --> 00:14:23.707
What did you say?

00:14:23.707 --> 00:14:26.301
Wait and see!
I'll prove it to you right away! Jan!

00:14:26.443 --> 00:14:27.774
Water supply start!

00:14:28.078 --> 00:14:29.477
- Alan!
- Plastic bag set up!

00:14:29.847 --> 00:14:31.405
Rain Genie EX! Ready!

00:14:31.548 --> 00:14:34.483
What is it? Get right to it!

00:14:35.519 --> 00:14:37.316
Science takes time.

00:14:37.521 --> 00:14:40.149
Then, Sugar will turn them
into snow flakes!

00:14:40.891 --> 00:14:42.017
Uh! Stop!

00:14:43.760 --> 00:14:44.727
Stop it!

00:14:47.998 --> 00:14:50.834
Is everyone all right?

00:14:50.834 --> 00:14:52.369
I'm all right.

00:14:52.369 --> 00:14:53.537
That's strange.

00:14:53.537 --> 00:14:56.540
According to my calculations,
the volume of the steam was...

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.442
How do you manage to make
the rain explode?
What is this?
How come we didn't get snow?

00:15:00.511 --> 00:15:03.412
I'm gonna do the calculation
one more time!
What is it, Saga?

00:15:03.514 --> 00:15:04.503
Enough is enough!

00:15:05.015 --> 00:15:07.483
Thanks to you I was late for school!
And I got embarrassed in public!

00:15:07.551 --> 00:15:11.487
I can't concentrate on my classes. What
are you gonna do about ruining my day?

00:15:11.555 --> 00:15:15.526
I don't care if you're a Season Fairy or what!
Why don't you be more sensitive to...

00:15:15.526 --> 00:15:17.494
...creating problems for others!

00:15:19.062 --> 00:15:23.534
- Bye! See you tomorrow!
- Bye! Let's go play!

00:15:23.534 --> 00:15:25.536
If you have worries, tell me.

00:15:25.536 --> 00:15:30.473
I'll keep it a secret between you and me.
All right?

00:15:30.541 --> 00:15:35.512
Miss Saga, you are always punctual.
But, you were late this morning.

00:15:35.512 --> 00:15:39.516
During the class you were absent-minded.

00:15:39.516 --> 00:15:42.519
I'm concerned about you, Miss Saga.

00:15:42.519 --> 00:15:45.511
So, if you have worries,
I'd like you to talk to me.

00:15:48.392 --> 00:15:50.826
Saga was really mad.

00:15:53.530 --> 00:15:56.533
No wonder Ms. Hanna is worried.

00:15:56.533 --> 00:15:59.069
But, who would
believe that I picked up a fairy

00:15:59.069 --> 00:16:01.538
yesterday and I'm the
only one who can see it?

00:16:01.538 --> 00:16:07.443
Uh. My plan with Anne and Norma was
completely ruined, too. This is all...

00:16:08.345 --> 00:16:09.642
Uh! Saga!

00:16:10.514 --> 00:16:11.515
...this thing's fault!

00:16:11.515 --> 00:16:12.516
Saga, Saga, Saga, Saga, Saga!

00:16:12.516 --> 00:16:16.213
Um... I'm sorry about earlier. Uh... I'm...

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:17.646
Wait for me!

00:16:18.522 --> 00:16:20.786
Saga! Please wait for a second!

00:16:21.191 --> 00:16:23.056
Well, are you still mad?

00:16:23.627 --> 00:16:27.495
I said I was sorry, didn't I?
Please, Saga, please!

00:16:29.533 --> 00:16:30.534
Wait, please!

00:16:30.534 --> 00:16:34.368
Could it be that Saga
can't see me any longer?

00:16:34.538 --> 00:16:35.766
Oops! My, oh-my...

00:16:38.141 --> 00:16:42.373
Saga! Uh! You are seeing me! Come on!
Don't scare me like that!

00:16:42.512 --> 00:16:44.275
We're parting our ways here.

00:16:44.514 --> 00:16:45.515
What?

00:16:45.515 --> 00:16:48.006
I'm going to pretend that
I didn't pick you up.

00:16:48.118 --> 00:16:52.487
I'll pretend I didn't see you. So, you, too,
should start from scratch right here.

00:16:53.523 --> 00:16:57.015
Why? Tell me why?

00:16:57.094 --> 00:17:01.428
Ever since I picked you up yesterday,
my plans have been messed up.

00:17:01.531 --> 00:17:04.534
First of all,
you were not even part of my plan.

00:17:04.534 --> 00:17:06.370
And, besides, I'm not the type of person

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.605
who believes in
Season Fairies to begin with...

00:17:08.605 --> 00:17:10.300
- There she is! Sugar!
- Sugar!

00:17:12.175 --> 00:17:14.478
- Where have you been?
- We've been looking for you.

00:17:14.478 --> 00:17:16.546
Wow! Salt! Pepper!

00:17:16.546 --> 00:17:19.481
Ah! Pepper!

00:17:22.552 --> 00:17:23.520
Salt!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.545
- Ugh! No, Don't! Sugar!
- Salt!

00:17:25.622 --> 00:17:28.819
Well, Sugar hasn't changed at all!

00:17:28.892 --> 00:17:32.589
- Don't. Stop it! Stop it! No, no, no! Sugar!
- Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss...

00:17:32.763 --> 00:17:35.425
Ah! I almost forgot! Well, Saga... Saga!

00:17:35.499 --> 00:17:38.535
Let me introduce them. This is my friend,
Sun Fairy, Salt.

00:17:38.535 --> 00:17:41.470
And, Wind Fairy, Pepper.

00:17:41.538 --> 00:17:44.473
Of course, they are both just like me,
in the middle of apprenticeship!

00:17:44.541 --> 00:17:47.237
What are you doing, Sugar?

00:17:47.344 --> 00:17:52.372
Even if you try to introduce us,
humans cannot see us.

00:17:52.516 --> 00:17:55.452
That's right. Ah, what a depressing look.

00:17:55.452 --> 00:17:58.522
What are you doing
talking to such a human?

00:17:58.522 --> 00:18:00.683
Excuse my depressing look!

00:18:01.525 --> 00:18:04.761
Ha, ha! Saga can see us.

00:18:04.761 --> 00:18:10.100
Come to think of it, very rarely there
are humans who can see Season Fairies.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.465
I read so in a book.

00:18:11.535 --> 00:18:14.766
Wow. So, this is one of them. Awesome!

00:18:14.838 --> 00:18:17.966
It's not like I see you because I want to.

00:18:18.508 --> 00:18:20.408
Ah, by the way, Sugar...

00:18:20.544 --> 00:18:22.478
Have you already planted the
"Magic Seed"?

00:18:22.879 --> 00:18:24.278
Well, not quite yet...

00:18:25.449 --> 00:18:28.509
- I've already planted mine!
- Of course, I did, too.

00:18:29.519 --> 00:18:33.523
Cheaters! You both cheated!
Ah! I haven't done it yet!

00:18:33.523 --> 00:18:37.527
I haven't picked a place to live
in the human world!
What are you talking about? Planting the
"Magic Seed" and picking a place to live are...

00:18:37.527 --> 00:18:42.260
I don't know what to do.
What shall I do? What shall I do?
...the very first things to do in the human world.
You learned that at school, too, didn't you?

00:18:42.365 --> 00:18:44.034
What? Did I?

00:18:44.034 --> 00:18:48.538
Besides, unless we find "Twinkle" and
make the "Magic Flower" bloom soon,

00:18:48.538 --> 00:18:52.509
we can't become a
fully-fledged Season Fairy.

00:18:52.509 --> 00:18:55.535
Hee, hee! Mine has already sprouted!

00:18:55.612 --> 00:18:58.148
- Really?
- Yeah, do you wanna come see?

00:18:58.148 --> 00:18:59.843
I wanna go, I wanna go. I wanna go!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.779
See you later, Saga! Bye-bye!

00:19:02.552 --> 00:19:06.989
What was that?
What in the world was that?

00:19:08.125 --> 00:19:09.456
- I'm home!
- Welcome home.

00:19:09.526 --> 00:19:12.829
It'll take a little longer
before dinner is ready.

00:19:12.829 --> 00:19:14.498
Go ahead and take a bath.

00:19:14.498 --> 00:19:15.157
O.K.

00:19:18.769 --> 00:19:21.670
Why? Tell me why?

00:19:22.539 --> 00:19:24.473
She was crying.

00:19:24.541 --> 00:19:29.412
No, no, no!
I'm gonna forget about that thing!

00:19:29.412 --> 00:19:32.381
Starting tomorrow,
I'll go back to my normal life.

00:19:36.286 --> 00:19:37.844
Don't tell me...

00:19:42.926 --> 00:19:45.986
- What... What is this?
- Not here! Not here! Not here!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:49.727
Not here! Not here! Not here! I can't
find it anywhere!

00:19:52.536 --> 00:19:55.471
You! What are you doing here?

00:19:55.972 --> 00:20:00.534
Saga! What shall I do? What shall I do?
I can't find it anywhere! I lost it!

00:20:02.445 --> 00:20:05.380
- What shall I do?
- You said you lost something?
What did you lose?

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.484
"Magic Seed".

00:20:09.553 --> 00:20:13.421
"Magic Seed"? You mean the ones you
guys were talking about earlier?

00:20:13.523 --> 00:20:14.490
Yes.

00:20:15.525 --> 00:20:17.561
When the place to live is decided,
the seed needs to be planted.

00:20:17.561 --> 00:20:20.897
And, we look for a "Twinkle" and let the
"Magic Flower" bloom. Otherwise,

00:20:20.897 --> 00:20:23.195
we can't become a fully-fledged
Season Fairy.

00:20:23.533 --> 00:20:26.093
Ugh! Are you positive you lost it in here?

00:20:28.538 --> 00:20:33.100
Dear "Magic Seed", where are you?
Please come out!

00:20:35.846 --> 00:20:38.747
The "Magic Seed" that you're looking for...
Is that it?

00:20:41.484 --> 00:20:44.078
Ah! It's sprouted!

00:20:44.521 --> 00:20:47.524
I see. I guess I dropped it in here.

00:20:47.524 --> 00:20:51.426
Now you've found it. Pick it up right
away and get going.

00:20:51.528 --> 00:20:54.698
It's already sprouted.
So, I can't take it away.

00:20:54.698 --> 00:20:56.063
What? Which... which means...

00:20:56.132 --> 00:20:57.099
That's right.

00:20:57.534 --> 00:20:59.536
From today on,
this is officially my house!

00:20:59.536 --> 00:21:04.838
Excuse me!
Why do I have to live with Sugar?

00:21:04.908 --> 00:21:08.969
Ah! For the first time you call me Sugar!

00:21:09.679 --> 00:21:10.646
Saga!

00:21:15.518 --> 00:21:18.521
Watch over me, Saga.
I'll do my very best.

00:21:18.521 --> 00:21:21.524
I'll find my "Twinkle",
make my "Magic Flower" bloom and...

00:21:21.524 --> 00:21:24.527
become a full-fledged Season Fairy.

00:21:24.527 --> 00:21:27.530
And, just like my dear Mommy,
I'll become a great Snow...

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:30.499
Huh?
Now I feel relieved and... kind of sleepy...

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:42.410
Saga! Dinner!

00:21:42.545 --> 00:21:44.479
Uh... O. K!

00:21:56.526 --> 00:21:59.495
Somehow this has
taken an unexpected turn.

00:22:20.550 --> 00:22:24.486
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.522 --> 00:22:28.582
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:29.059 --> 00:22:33.792
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:34.531 --> 00:22:37.500
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:39.536 --> 00:22:47.510
Nana-iro no hashi o wataru kaze

00:22:47.510 --> 00:22:52.311
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:52.549 --> 00:22:57.179
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:59.283
Sugar Snow

00:22:59.556 --> 00:23:07.258
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:12.535
Kirei na hana saku kisetsu ni

00:23:12.535 --> 00:23:16.494
Anata o omou

00:23:19.709 --> 00:23:23.475
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:23.546 --> 00:23:28.040
ai wa, yume wa

00:23:28.518 --> 00:23:35.481
sono mune ni aruno

00:23:40.130 --> 00:23:42.428
Preview for the Next Episode.
Well, so many things have happened,

00:23:42.465 --> 00:23:44.634
but the "Magic Flower" finally bloomed!
So, that was good.

00:23:44.634 --> 00:23:49.539
It's NOT good! Without permission, you
barged into my room. It's against the rules!

00:23:49.539 --> 00:23:53.743
Well, don't be too uptight! Now you
have such a cute roommate! Right?

00:23:53.743 --> 00:23:57.514
Dear God, did I do something bad?

00:23:57.514 --> 00:24:00.850
Saga is so happy that she's crying!
It makes me a little embarrassed.

00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:01.518
Yeah, right!

00:24:01.518 --> 00:24:05.522
"A Little Snow Fairy, Sugar"
The next episode is
"Twinkle-Twinkle, Comfy-Warm, Puffy-Fluffy".

00:24:05.522 --> 00:24:08.491
By the way, where can I find a "Twinkle"?
